{"id":"quick","corpus":"aws","title":"Amazon Quick","sourceUrl":"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/quick/latest/userguide/what-is.html","license":"AWS Documentation © Amazon Web Services, Inc.","blocks":[{"kind":"h1","text":"Amazon Quick"},{"kind":"p","text":"Amazon Quick is an AI-powered service for automating tasks, analyzing data, building web applications, and conducting research. You interact with Quick through natural language chat, and Quick uses AI agents to process your requests against connected data sources and applications."},{"kind":"p","text":"Quick includes the following features:"},{"kind":"li","text":"Amazon Quick Sight – Interactive data visualization and business intelligence. Connect to data sources, build dashboards, and embed analytics in applications."},{"kind":"li","text":"Amazon Quick Flows – Automate repetitive tasks with AI-powered workflows that use your data and take actions in connected applications."},{"kind":"li","text":"Amazon Quick Automate – Build business process automations with AI agents that make contextual decisions and execute actions across applications."},{"kind":"li","text":"Amazon Quick Index – Connect your organization's documents and data sources so AI responses are grounded in your information."},{"kind":"li","text":"Amazon Quick Research – Conduct in-depth research across the web and your data, delivered as a cited report."},{"kind":"li","text":"Apps in Amazon Quick – Build interactive web applications by describing what you need in natural language."},{"kind":"p","text":"Amazon Quick evolved from Amazon QuickSight. QuickSight continues as Amazon Quick Sight, a feature within Quick. All existing QuickSight APIs, SDKs, and integrations continue to work without changes."},{"kind":"h2","text":"Benefits of Quick"},{"kind":"p","text":"Everything in one place"},{"kind":"p","text":"Agents, research, automation, analytics, and app building are all built in. You don't need separate products for each capability."},{"kind":"p","text":"Fully managed"},{"kind":"p","text":"No infrastructure to provision, no models to host, no ML expertise required."},{"kind":"p","text":"Connects to your tools and data"},{"kind":"p","text":"Quick integrates with the apps, databases, and systems your organization already uses through knowledge bases, action connectors, extensions, and structured data connections. Open standards including Model Context Protocol (MCP) and OpenAPI let you connect any system."},{"kind":"p","text":"Meets you where you work"},{"kind":"p","text":"Use Quick from the web, the desktop application, or directly inside Chrome, Slack, Microsoft Teams, and Microsoft 365 applications."},{"kind":"p","text":"AI you can trust"},{"kind":"p","text":"Quick runs on AWS with the same identity, network, and compliance controls your security team already approved. Your data stays in your control."},{"kind":"h2","text":"Accessing Quick"},{"kind":"p","text":"To start using Amazon Quick, you have two options:"},{"kind":"li","text":"Sign up at aws.com/quick – Use your email or social credentials (Google, Apple, Amazon, GitHub). No AWS account required. Free and Plus plans available."},{"kind":"li","text":"Provision through the AWS Management Console – Configure Quick for your organization with IAM Identity Center or IAM Federation. Per-user subscriptions with standard AWS billing."},{"kind":"h2","text":"Getting started"},{"kind":"p","text":"To start using Quick immediately, sign up at aws.com/quick."},{"kind":"p","text":"If your organization uses AWS:"},{"kind":"li","text":"How Amazon Quick works – Learn how Quick components work together."},{"kind":"li","text":"Setting up and signing into Amazon Quick – Configure Quick for your organization."},{"kind":"li","text":"Getting started with Amazon Quick – Start a conversation, explore features, and see what Quick can do."}],"lemmas":{"amazons":["amazon","amazons"],"quicks":["quick","quicks"],"powered":["powered","power"],"powereds":["powereds","powered"],"powers":["po